{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_16208030","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16208030","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1620803001:1":{"text":"図書館にお化けがいる。間違いない……！","source_cn":"图书馆里在闹鬼，绝对是这样……不会错的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFFC8A4D05CC9766C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1620803002:0":{"text":"マジかよ……先生か誰かが調べてくれないのか？何かあったらどうするんだ……","source_cn":"太吓人了……校方没有派人出来管管吗？万一出了事怎么办？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F4AF58E329DECD2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1620803003:1":{"text":"落ち着いて、アンセル。ここはレヒラムなのよ。ただの暴走した魔法道具かもしれないわ。ここじゃ、そういうのがしょっちゅう飛び回ってるでしょ？","source_cn":"冷静点。安塞尔，会不会是你想多了？这里可是莱希拉姆，说...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCBAEE090649299EE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1620803004:1":{"text":"いいや、あれは魔法なんかじゃない。俺が図書館で経験したことは……魔法なんかじゃ説明がつかないんだ……","source_cn":"不！这次肯定不是魔法。那天我在图书馆经历的事……完全无...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x948B01FDF6C31642","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1620803005:1":{"text":"昨日の夜、錬金テストの勉強をしてたんだけど、俺、レシピを覚えるのが大の苦手でさ……","source_cn":"昨天晚上，我正为炼金课程测试发愁。那么多配方，我一条都...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCBBBDF41EBC82699","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","varian